          ],
          "sectionId": 31517
        }
      ],
      "title": "#4 日轮光晕"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31518001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮......我想看到「优纪」的命运。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "怎么会呢，水面没有显示出任何结果......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "难道说......提问的对象不够明确？\n优纪就是优纪，我的伙伴优纪......不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "唔......究竟是哪里出现了问题呢？\n再来一次好了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "咯吱——啪嚓！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "木棍断裂......这是对灵媒师的危险警示！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "唰————！！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "哦呀？居然勉强躲开了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "你是谁？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "好问题。在被我带走之前，伟大的「通灵女巫」不如占上一卦，让神来给你答案？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "这种程度的问题，不需要占卜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "「天启」收集能量石、绑架手办有两名执行者，「水城结奈」已经现身，而你就是另一位——「花鸟原」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "很好。我向来觉得，占卜师不过是高端点的骗子罢了——别用那种眼神看我，我敬佩能让人们信服的骗子们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31518014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "不过现在，你让我有所改观了。\n让我想想，该怎么奖励你才好呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "奇怪，桑尼不是留下看家的吗，怎么不开门？\n又溜出去采那些奇怪的植物了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "门是虚掩着的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "别看我，我确认自己有锁门！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "不对劲。小心前进。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "唔......唔唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "抱歉，你们来迟了一步。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "站住！有本事来单挑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "「单挑」？真是个愚蠢的词。\n很可惜，我对你没兴趣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31519009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "她从窗户翻出去了，追！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-276",
