      ],
      "title": "#5 木灵警示"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31521001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "桑尼被扛在肩上......她好像失去意识了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31521002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "加大马力，阿尔贝尔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31521003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "不妙......我要赶快告诉主人才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "任务完成。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "你又带着「尾巴」回来。\n我可不想每天更换据点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "现在保证效率最要紧，不是计较那些细枝末节的时候。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "试仪式就要启动了。\n她们闯进来的话，怎么应对？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "该好好想想怎么应对的——应该是她们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "右转弯！我看到了，就在前面的仓库。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "咳——就差一点，让她们进去了！\n不好办，这种地形非常容易设埋伏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "哪来那么多废话，救人要紧。\n卡缪，掩护我！找准时机进攻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "阳光，可以灼烧一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "嘶——我的右手......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "干得漂亮！她松手了，阳子，接住人质！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "咣当——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "阳子小心！有东西掉下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "压住了吗？压扁了吗？压成流心软糖了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "咳、咳咳！\n有本事用拳头说话，别耍阴招！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "接下来是第二弹哦。\n准备好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "小鬼，别得意忘形了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "糖果从天上......滑过去了？\n不好，卡缪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "！！！！呃！\n你......竟敢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "桑尼已经救下来了，这里不宜久留！\n你们带着卡缪先撤，我来殿后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花鸟原",
          "text": "事到如今还想走吗？\n留下来陪我，好好找点乐子吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31522022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "今天就陪你玩个痛快！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-277",
